  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-81599",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We distribute the conjunction over the disjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\nP∧(Q∨R)≡(P∧Q)∨(P∧R)\n$$\n\nNow, since $P∧Q≡Q∧P$ and $P∧R≡R∧P,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(P∧Q)∨(P∧R)≡(Q∧P)∨(R∧P).\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
